# Design system

- Primary: `#00b3ee` (`primary`); dark `#0095c7` (`primary-dark` / `blue`); light `#33c2f1` (`primary-light` / `sky`).
- Ink `#0f172a`, bg `#f4fafd`, mut `#64748b`, line `#d7e8f0`, danger `#e11d48`.
- Font (whole app): `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif`.
- Global `p` font-size: `12px` via `@campuz360/ui/globals.css`.
- Use `@campuz360/ui` primitives. Do not load Plus Jakarta Sans or alternate brand palettes.
- Tokens live in `packages/config/tailwind-preset.css`.
